speechtext:
I move to amend section 15, by adding the following subsection ;
At least fifty copies of the said notice shall also be published by proclamation at least two weeks before the nomination posted up in conspicuous places throughout the territory at sufficient distances from each other to ensure notice to all parts of the said electoral district.
I do not know whether the hon. minister is willing to agreeVo the proposed amendment. If he is, I shall not waste the time of the House in discussing it, but if not, I will say a few words.
